## 1.1 Project Name

CARPOOLX

## 1.2 Tagline

"Move Together. Go Further."

Alternative brand statement:

"Your Route. Your People. One Shared Ride."

## 1.3 Project Description

CarpoolX is a database-driven carpooling platform designed to connect passengers and drivers travelling along similar routes.

Passengers can search for rides, identify compatible journeys, reserve seats and share transportation expenses.

Drivers can publish available rides, manage booking requests and coordinate journeys.

Administrators can monitor platform activities, manage users, transactions and reports.

Carpool coordinators can assist with passenger-driver matching, ride coordination and operational issue management.

The system aims to reduce transportation expenses, improve vehicle occupancy, reduce unnecessary traffic and make shared transportation more accessible.

